          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चमकदार (camakdār) is camak, \"shine\", from camaknā, \"to glitter\", which CDIAL lists under a reconstructed camakka, \"sudden movement\" (CDIAL 4676), with the Persian ending -dār, \"holder\"."
