          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धुंधला (dhũdhlā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from dhūmāndha, \"dim-sighted\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 6858). It is built from dhūma, \"smoke\", and andha, \"blind\"."
